  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1408.04 Conversion of Decks and Porches Prohibited",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1408.04 Conversion of Decks and Porches Prohibited. In accordance with RSA 483-B:11, I, no deck or porch located between the primary building line and the reference line shall be converted to become part of the primary living space.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1400) #12062 eff 12-17-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1400.html"
